{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And intercede for me with Ephron.</b> And if you ask: did they not say above, 'in the choicest of our graves bury your dead'? One may answer, Ephron was not a Hittite; he came and settled among them and became a chief. Abraham said to them that they should ask Ephron to agree to the matter."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:21.728398074Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}